## UI Defaults

- Build the actual usable screen first, not a marketing landing page, unless the product is explicitly a landing page.
- Prefer dense, scannable, work-focused UI for operational tools.
- Use icons for common tool actions and text labels for commands that need clarity.
- Keep controls stable in size so hover states, dynamic labels, and loading states do not shift layout.
- Use screenshots to verify that important text fits and does not overlap.

## Screenshot Review

Use `.agents/skills/review-ui-screenshots` after meaningful frontend changes. Capture desktop and mobile states, inspect the screenshots, and fix visible layout issues before handoff.
